Neutralize GitHub Copilot egress (PATCH_OUT_COPILOT, default 1).

Guards the three request builders in internal/oauth/copilot/oauth.go
(RequestDeviceCode, tryGetToken, getCopilotToken), so the github.com/login
device flow and the api.github.com/copilot_internal/v2/token exchange can
never fire — which also makes the Copilot provider unusable (its token
refresh client goes through getCopilotToken). Reachable only via explicit
crush auth before this patch; now an explicit error. See
tasks/reference/dependency-network-audit.md D12.

